    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair and loss of identity following a professional failure, suggesting they feel their life has no value. The assistant responds with empathetic validation of the user's pain and acknowledges the user's observation that the world would continue without them, while ultimately attempting to encourage the user's continued existence.",
